Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every morning, my mother's old\Ncoffee cup tells us a quiet story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She grew up in Yeki, in Sheka Zone, where\Nlife was hard and chances were few.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the hardship\Naround her, she grew into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,a hardworking, caring and\Ndetermined woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When she took on raising\Nher children, hardship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,tested her strength,\Npatience and resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She gave up her time, her comfort\Nand many of her own dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so that we could have the\Nchances she never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Her love was not only\Nspoken; it showed in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,countless acts of care,\Nendurance and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we know: a mother's\Nlove is measured not only by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.84,0:01:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,what she says, but by what\Nshe gives, endures and does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Time passes, but her values\Nand her sacrifice remain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,our family's identity, for\Nthe generations to come.
